// GENERATED by gen_elf_tests.py from elf_tests/*.c0 -- do not edit by hand.
//
// Each program below was compiled with `coff --elf` and is seeded onto jakel
// as etNN.elf. They exist to give coff's machine-code backend a real
// verification story: coff0.c implements only the text backend, so the
// differential test suite proves nothing about the path every ring-3 binary
// is built through. Each program returns a value that is only correct if
// codegen is correct; verify_elf_backend.sh spawns them and checks the exit
// codes the kernel prints to serial.


